<p>Everything carries a 2-year workmanship warranty from Austin Landscape Lighting on top of the manufacturer warranties on fixtures and the transformer. Brass path lights routinely last decades; the LED modules inside are rated for 40,000 hours or more, which at six hours a night is roughly eighteen years.</p>
